    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different trucks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Trucker Joe, you build up your own freight company. You start with an old, weak truck, but later on, with your hard-earned money, you can buy some seriously cool rigs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.poster.avif?t=1754220989\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.webm?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.mp4?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You place the companies on the map!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should strategically consider where to place each company to avoid unnecessary detours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.poster.avif?t=1754220989\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.webm?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.mp4?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different companies require specialized trailers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every type of cargo needs the right trailer! Whether it's delivering heavy construction equipment or frozen pizza, you\u2019ll need the right trailer for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.poster.avif?t=1754220989\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.webm?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.mp4?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different trucks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Trucker Joe, you build up your own freight company. You start with an old, weak truck, but later on, with your hard-earned money, you can buy some seriously cool rigs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.poster.avif?t=1754220989\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.webm?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/a3f198d28a320f09e881ea5240cb4d03.mp4?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You place the companies on the map!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should strategically consider where to place each company to avoid unnecessary detours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.poster.avif?t=1754220989\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.webm?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/93f4ec3655ebfb3798c775c47957cbc3.mp4?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different companies require specialized trailers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every type of cargo needs the right trailer! Whether it's delivering heavy construction equipment or frozen pizza, you\u2019ll need the right trailer for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.poster.avif?t=1754220989\" width=618 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.webm?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/5d15cc5ecbe2077ae02e2a7b481ecd20.mp4?t=1754220989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "As Trucker Joe, you take control of your own freight company, buying trucks and a wide range of trailers to keep the companies\u2019 supply chains running smoothly! Place the companies strategically on your map to avoid long hauls!",
